160
00:03:58,260 --> 00:03:59,600
nicotine's the hook.

161
00:03:59,620 --> 00:04:01,600
Cochrane says a patch plus gum or

162
00:04:01,620 --> 00:04:03,440
lozenge beats just one.

163
00:04:03,460 --> 00:04:05,360
And a prescription called varenicline beats

164
00:04:05,380 --> 00:04:07,550
a single form of nicotine replacement.

165
00:04:07,700 --> 00:04:09,470
Any pharmacy can point you right.

166
00:04:09,540 --> 00:04:10,430
No shame.

167
00:04:10,740 --> 00:04:11,600
Tip three,

168
00:04:11,620 --> 00:04:12,960
