183
00:04:30,260 --> 00:04:31,200
Bring gum.

184
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:32,240
Leave early.

185
00:04:32,260 --> 00:04:33,520
Have your line ready:

186
00:04:33,540 --> 00:04:34,080
"nah,

187
00:04:34,100 --> 00:04:36,320
